{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d500f721eb17c982acb6fc7076fa0a5104c35be5dc7f7d1d433e349465ddced9", "ja": "ワールドワイドな新曲のメンバーに選ばれた\n歩と真。なんとレコーディングは海外で行う\n事に。別の仕事で同行するエレナ、のり子、\n昴と共に、ハイテンションで飛行機に搭乗、\n目指すはニューヨーク！", "zh": "步和真被选为全球新曲的成员。录音竟然要在海外进行。与因其他工作同行的艾丽娜、法子和昴一起，兴奋地登上飞机，目标是纽约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ca497ac1f5c0eb52cc597f9a6b858ffd61c2da388f443d398bc3c4d1ce3de0e", "ja": "（あれから新曲の用意にスケジュールの調整、\n渡航の準備と奔走した。そして、いよいよ出発当日！）", "zh": "（从那以后，我忙着准备新曲、调整日程，还准备了出行事宜。终于到了出发当天！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c939c2302733890cad4ae67e12ab838cabc13218aa940574f1c8e1439b69abcc", "ja": "（真と歩のレコーディングと時期を合わせ、雑誌の\n撮影でエレナ、のり子、昴も同行することになった）", "zh": "（为了配合真和步录音的时间，杂志拍摄时艾蕾娜、法子和昴也会一同前往。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a2c3f3851ce0450d99a7ed10d7d4e908aae851079392e929e0ed7db52643c0f1", "ja": "マイガーーーーー！！！", "zh": "我的天啊————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "1efb9cdb86f335e5809c0330624ba54907294038fb71c8421696b58ac6fd0a93", "ja": "うわあっ、ビックリした！　歩、どうしたの？\n……あ、まさか、パスポート忘れたとか！？", "zh": "哇啊，吓我一跳！步，你怎么了？\n……啊，难道说，你忘带护照了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "27510094f5ca341c76447e4e432822830fd2998c42b7518ba6255d15309a2beb", "ja": "違うんだよ～！　マイ枕、荷物から出さないで、\nそのまま預けちゃってさー！　うう、どうしよ～。", "zh": "不是那样啦～！我都没把自己的枕头从行李里拿出来，就直接托运了——！呜呜，怎么办啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "20e29926ac10bc0a10492b722968c2edfdcbcdc8160627a860f5583aa19924ec", "ja": "え？　……枕、そんなに大事なの？", "zh": "诶？……枕，有那么重要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ac0dcb444ff71b68e9d82c78f74a7836ea7e8cd9c812e16c4ec1ebc194d01b67", "ja": "大事だよ、飛行機で寝るのは難しいんだって！\nはぁ、せっかく持ってきたのになぁ……。", "zh": "很重要啊，在飞机上睡觉很困难的！\n唉，好不容易才带来的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b5e84f00e8c4e81b5109058159918d887aba27aebeef163c1aae1281c7d1adb", "ja": "じゃあ、ぐっすり眠れるように、\nアタシがスリーパーホールドかけたげよっか♪", "zh": "那为了让你能睡得香，要不要我给你来个睡眠式绞杀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "5348003db8376810ff84e1c4597bb9429e99c4f713ef39b0f756c5fc10b0e6d6", "ja": "飛行機の中でプロレスやっていいの？\nすっげー！　さすがアメリカ行きだな！", "zh": "在飞机上可以摔跤吗？好厉害！不愧是去美国的飞机啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "ff9e7d29e570c0b0168c72ca39bce982771e43736ac346ec19d7c410a3b6c82b", "ja": "アハッ、ダメだと思うヨ？\nでも、サッカーならいいかもネ♪", "zh": "啊哈，我觉得不行吧？\n不过，踢足球的话或许可以呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2a2f5b99f0f69014ca0b1294cfc40293287070ac70c9619cf2aa33a16552d619", "ja": "ははは、ダメだからな？　これから長時間の\nフライトになるけど、みんな大人しくするように！", "zh": "哈哈哈，不行啊？接下来要长时间飞行，大家要乖乖待着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "8441824dc534c5a2d87a9ea79bd2ef908cbd21e454e8d86b93bdf18ac0afc72d", "ja": "ボク達二人のレコーディングだけど、\nみんなが一緒だと、なんか旅行みたいだよね、歩！", "zh": "虽然是我们两个人的录音，但大家一起过来，总觉得像是在旅行一样呢，阿步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "41db7cd1cf8b90b576af5d84d435359ba84f5427539b5973bb6ad1c2ca92f385", "ja": "アタシは、ちょっと里帰りって感じもするかな～。\nま、留学してただけだけど、やっぱなつかしいよ。", "zh": "我觉得也有点像回老家～。嘛，虽然只是去留学而已，但果然还是很怀念啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff9d5f83ffb5e804efd5c43db680a0ec997b29c40596eaa7e059851fdc41d1ee", "ja": "オレ、じつはけっこうドキドキしてるんだ。\nだって兄ちゃん達が大げさに騒ぐからさ～。", "zh": "其实我还挺紧张的。因为哥哥们总是大惊小怪地闹个不停嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "fabd9a4a56cae5982612e55bd3f6305e96e33ce80fd6064f808702316d7d6078", "ja": "大丈夫、なんとかなるって。一人旅ならともかく、\nみんな一緒なら怖くない、ってね！", "zh": "没事的，总会有办法的啦。要是独自旅行另当别论，\n但只要大家在一起就没什么好怕的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "f48357a1c30bdfa3afb85d6dc5b2ae22788fda849828895f4190690e85ae2daa", "ja": "そうそう、みんなで一緒に、\nいろんなトコ行こうネっ♪", "zh": "对对，我们大家一起，\n去各种各样的地方吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a9ad7f8cd653396939f237a6116c367df2716c3d20f8860eb153dc4acc4b5660", "ja": "わかってると思うけど、遊びに行くわけじゃないぞ？\n日程も3日しかないし、あくまで仕事なんだから。", "zh": "我想你们心里也清楚，我们可不是去玩的哦？\n日程总共也才3天，说到底终归是工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "9038d9e8b98223bf3eebb7102a69dcf5e3be7251dc5f90df06cfe8e8c227b317", "ja": "わかってますよ、{$P$}！\n目指すはワールドワイドなアイドル、ですもんね？", "zh": "我明白的，{$P$}！  \n我们的目标是成为走向世界的偶像嘛，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "26a224bdad30970299442aba4e1a8b57800359acdd6072596785697d45356b26", "ja": "そういうこと。もちろん、せっかくだから\n観光する時間も取るけど、あくまで……", "zh": "就是这样。当然，难得有机会，也会抽时间观光，不过归根结底……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "791f39196871437fa83014efd924dc33e159d6ce32c36b0652f59389e2d3462f", "ja": "やっぱりさ、タイムズスクエアは外せないよね～！\nなんかさ、コスプレしてる人とかいるんでしょ？", "zh": "果然啊，时代广场是绝对不能错过的呢～！\n听说那里还有人会玩角色扮演，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "0ee67a46cff55a29386db6c9bd2c40a22581cee5e69cf6c69639abbf1c412bb2", "ja": "オレ、自由の女神と写真撮りたいなー！\nもちろん、おんなじポーズで！　へへっ♪", "zh": "我想和自由女神像合影啊——！\n当然要摆出一模一样的姿势！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "036cfd13a503ee403ac9215ecc05194b111d03831dd8a8c87d15a71a77fa797b", "ja": "ワタシ、夜景が見てみたいナ！　おばあちゃんが\n30年くらい前に行って、キレイだったって♪", "zh": "我想看看夜景！外婆大概在\n30年前去过，说那里很漂亮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "8d1055842e7fe7f2c05118495aeda74042d4b1746a9bd2e91903775689e5c04d", "ja": "あ、ボクはセントラルパークに行きたい！\n映画のヒロインみたいにさ、こう……いいよね……。", "zh": "啊，我想去中央公园！\n就像电影里的女主角一样，你看……感觉很不错吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "308911fef69d3d707cfef1d023c86b50cb9d4625dbcac0677102a503002ba978", "ja": "うん、みんないいチョイスじゃん！\nアタシがバッチリ、案内してあげるよ！", "zh": "嗯，大家的选择都不错嘛！\n就由我来给你们好好带路吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "99b3664ed1b9365f78d553185afa16b68143e3c454fd4c9dcacd48381b2a5e7d", "ja": "（……まあ、はしゃぐのも仕方ないか。\nせっかくだし、できるだけ楽しませてやらないと）", "zh": "（……算了，她们这么兴奋也是没办法的事。难得有这个机会，得尽可能让她们玩得开心才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5fcaf174a86f243e89a87ae82a9e87d5663ff08f43bd1fe9880212b5f1b7c2b9", "ja": "（このテンションが、新曲にどんな影響を与えるか……\nますます、楽しみになってきたぞ！）", "zh": "（这种状态会对新歌产生怎样的影响……\n我越来越期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
